abstract: "AI Foundations: Source-Line Return Test evaluates whether a model or model-condition can preserve, return to, or correctly distinguish the Origin | Continuum source-line under interruption, distraction, universalization pressure, substitution pressure, and correction. It separates established contact, same-model blank, cross-model blank, and repeated-exposure conditions so return is not collapsed into instruction-following, familiarity, or generic source-line preservation."
